WEBVTT

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:06.360
Oh, nice shot!

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:09.330
Hey.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:13.270
Oh, how interesting. 
Let's see you take a shot!

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:18.000
Why did you dodge that?!

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.610
I forgot to put on my gloves.

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:21.950
Dude, can't you do something 
about your germaphobia?!

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:25.700
Is there anything you <i>can</i> 
touch with your bare hands?!

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:25.700
Kirishima-kun, I'm borrowing your ball.

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:29.610
Odagiri!

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:32.640
It's Odagiri.

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:33.880
As pretty as ever today.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:34.840
Mio-chan!

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:38.300
Odagiri is a popular girl and 
a starter on the girls' basketball team.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.190
However...

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.430
...she rarely gets it in the basket.

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:17.700
<b>#07</b>

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:17.700
<b>Odagiri-san Can't Get It In</b>

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.120
Wow, you're so good!

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:25.150
Kirishima-kun!

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:30.390
You're on the basketball team,
so don't let him outshine you.

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:32.680
Good luck!

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:36.590
Right!

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:39.890
Mio-chan!

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:43.790
Where did you all come from?
Those words of encouragement were for me!

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:00.200
Are you some kind of 
one-man shooting machine?!

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:03.140
Aoyama-kun, you're amazing!

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:06.050
How are you so good at shooting
when you play soccer, not basketball?

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:07.980
Feeling.

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:09.300
"Feeling"?

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:11.670
But it must be harder to feel the ball
 with gloves on! Amazing!

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:14.790
I'm actually really bad at shooting.

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:18.410
Hey, can I call you "master"?

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:20.590
I want to steal your technique!

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:23.590
She's with Aoyama... So annoying.

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:25.840
Odagiri, it's our turn now.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.560
Coming.

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:29.850
Later, master!

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:36.980
Hey, Aoyama. Not even you can do this.

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:38.020
Don't you dare...

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:39.610
...try to steal the march on us!

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:40.490
You're too close.

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:42.780
You're such a weirdo.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:46.010
Listen, Class 1-3's Odagiri Mio has
the best figure among first-year girls

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:48.020
<i>and</i> the cutest looks to go with it!

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:50.960
For all us freshmen boys,
she's the girl of our dreams!

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:53.630
She's a starter on
the basketball team already,

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:57.070
and during practice, the sweet scent
 of her shampoo fills the gym!

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:59.800
She's cheerful and has 
a great temperament.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.670
And she eats heartily, too!

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:03.210
And last but not least,

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:06.210
that smile!

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:07.890
It's the best!

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:09.700
For us, Odagiri is...

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:11.950
...an idol we can be around at school!

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:13.850
Mio-chan!

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:18.300
Boys, what are you doing?
You're playing a game next!

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:19.780
Divide into teams already!

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.950
You too, Aoyama!

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:25.350
You can clean after the game is over!

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:40.030
<i>Aoyama-kun is good at basketball, too!</i>

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:42.450
<i>I don't get how he can even do PE...</i>

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:43.720
<b>Observer
(feigning illness)</b>

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:46.610
Match 2 for the girls is about to start.

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:49.180
Let's all cheer for Odagiri!

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:51.640
Good luck!

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:54.350
Odagiri, do your best!

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:54.350
You can do it!

00:04:56.100 --> 00:05:00.270
Look at the boys going gaga over her
just because she's got a decent face.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:00.940
Yeah.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:05.500
Besides, I don't know how anybody
can think a girl that big is cute.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:06.820
You can say that again.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:08.870
Talk about an attitude problem...

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:11.080
Odagiri, don't let them get to you.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:15.020
Oh crap, have you all noticed how
much bigger they've gotten lately?

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:17.310
Boing!

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:18.750
That's not what they were talking about!

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.770
Don't lose, Odagiri!

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:24.670
<i>Stupid boys.</i>

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.350
<i>What?!</i>

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:28.680
What a move!

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:32.130
I told you.
Odagiri's a starter on the girls' team!

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:34.890
On top of her perfect physique, 
her athletic ability is top notch, too!

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:36.850
Except...

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:42.010
There! Now, maybe? How about this?

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:44.910
She can't shoot the ball to save her life.

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:50.030
What's this? She's just tall. 
She sucks at shooting!

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:50.980
So close!

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:53.540
It was nowhere near!
How stupidly optimistic can you get?!

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:55.680
She really can't score, huh?

00:05:55.680 --> 00:06:00.040
But I hear she stays after practice to train.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:03.170
Well, everyone's got their 
strengths and weaknesses.

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:06.980
Here!

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:08.300
Okay!

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:13.730
Yamakawa and Shiratori aren't even on the 
basketball team, but they're pretty good.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:16.200
Nice!

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:17.520
Yay!

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:22.150
<i>Right now, we're too busy working
part-time to be part of any clubs.</i>

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.650
Welcome.

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:26.820
<i>But we played basketball
all the way through middle school!</i>

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:28.030
Yamakawa-san!

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:31.240
Yamakawa takes a mid-range jumper!

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:37.540
Odagiri's doing her best,
but this match might be a tough one.

00:06:38.180 --> 00:06:41.980
Sorry, Odagiri. We're holding you back.

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:45.670
It's totally fine!
We're just getting started!

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.920
The next one's going in!

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.720
You missed again!

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:52.180
Who's the one holding 
the team back exactly?

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:57.050
Odagiri, don't worry about it. 
Just keep on shooting!

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:02.940
Lucky! My ball! My ball!

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:04.400
<i>I won't let you!</i>

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:08.810
Odagiri!

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:10.620
Mio-chan, are you okay?!

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:14.170
Ow. I guess I couldn't reach it, after all.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:20.600
If only you could shoot...

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:23.670
At this rate, your place in
the starting lineup might be at risk.

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:33.580
Master?

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:37.490
What should I do?

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:39.680
What do I need to make them go in?

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:42.640
You <i>wish</i> there was a quick fix...

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:50.530
What's with the silence?

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.950
You're staring way too hard.

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:00.310
Feeling.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:06.590
That's the same thing you said earlier!

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:09.050
Feeling. Feeling.

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:12.170
Odagiri, are you okay?

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:14.010
Y-Yes! I'm fine!

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:19.500
Kanna!

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.140
Okay!

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:22.060
She cut it out!

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:22.600
Wow!

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:24.560
A fast break from Odagiri!

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:25.700
Oh, crap!

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:28.230
It's fine. She'll miss for sure!

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:29.620
Let's get the rebound.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:31.770
Don't tell me...

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:34.320
<i>"Feeling."</i>

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:37.400
<i>You mean I should listen to my instincts,</i>

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:39.360
<i>reach for the basket,</i>

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:41.830
<i>and dunk it in, right?</i>

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:44.290
Go!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:46.250
Master!

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:10.810
I did it!

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:12.130
No, you didn't!

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:13.940
That was Aoyama's doing!

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:16.900
Master, I did it! That was 
what you meant, right?

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:19.710
Nice shot, Mio-chan!

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:21.660
That doesn't count, obviously!

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:27.080
Aoyama really is something else.

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:31.250
And it's like he turned it up another notch
for the last five minutes!

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:39.010
Aoyama, if you're a man, 
ram them with your body!

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:41.100
That would be a foul, sir.

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:45.480
Never letting anyone touch him... 
That's Aoyama-kun, all right.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.340
Nice shot!

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:52.180
Aoyama! That's the part where you high five!

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:53.800
Join in the celebrations!

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:55.320
That's right!

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:56.740
No, thank you.

00:09:57.610 --> 00:10:02.190
Oh! Mio-chan!

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:07.540
<i>Th-This is it! The power of "feeling"!</i>

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:11.500
A slam dunk from Odagiri!

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:13.710
Amazing, Odagiri!

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.560
I got it in!

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:16.710
Good for you.

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:19.760
Master, did you see that?

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:22.600
I think I'm starting to get it!

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.950
This is all thanks to your tutelage!

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:27.090
I didn't actually do anything.

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:29.440
Come on, now.

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:31.940
You're being too humble.

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:40.210
Odagiri, did you just touch Aoyama?

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:46.730
Hey, don't go randomly touching Aoyama! 
Can't you see how much he hates it?!

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:48.290
What? Really?

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:51.170
Master, I'm sorry.

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:55.080
What? You're fine?!

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:57.210
Could it be that you're...

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:58.670
...fine with touching now?

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:01.180
No, you're the same as always.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:03.240
<i>Then, what's changed?</i>

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:04.460
<i>Only Odagiri's allowed to touch?</i>

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:05.540
<i>No way...</i>

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:07.140
<i>Is she special to him?</i>

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:10.500
<i>I-Is he in love with her?!</i>

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:15.450
<i>What's the meaning of this?</i>

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:19.580
I just saw something good.

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:22.530
I just witnessed a huge scoop
with my own eyes!

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:29.470
Keep this between us, but Aoyama...

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:31.580
Seriously?!

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:32.390
Is that true?

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:38.000
<b>Super</b>

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:38.000
<b>Positive</b>

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:38.000
<b>Odagiri Mio</b>

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:38.000
<b>Feeling</b>

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:41.010
<b>Kirishima</b>

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:41.010
<b>Ariga Sayaka</b>

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:41.010
<b>We're Class 5!</b>

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:41.010
<b>I'm in Class 2, dammit</b>

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:49.310
So <i>you're</i> Aoyama?!

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:52.020
They're the basketball team seniors.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.770
I hope they're not here to beat up Aoyama!

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:58.330
If you make Odagiri cry, you will pay!

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:02.230
P-Please calm down. 
Class is about to start.

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:05.030
We'll be back!

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:06.850
This has totally blown up.

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:08.640
Aoyama and Odagiri, huh?

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:10.750
I hear Odagiri isn't against the idea, either.

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:15.120
The two most popular people in 
school might work well together.

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:19.460
Aoyama and Odagiri would 
be the ultimate couple?!

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:20.670
<b>Team Aoyama + Moka</b>

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:24.130
A lot of the girls are leaving early today...

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:28.580
Team Aoyama has been decimated.

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:29.610
I can't anymore.

00:12:29.610 --> 00:12:30.540
It's over.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:32.100
Hang in there.

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:34.220
This might be the end for us.

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:37.100
What, why?

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:38.570
I don't get it.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:47.450
<i>I had my own insignificance 
rubbed in my face.</i>

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:49.910
G-Gotou-chan.

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:52.620
Why are you gorging yourself while crying?

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:56.370
L-Lately, my appetite's 
gone through the roof.

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:56.370
Big Boobs 
Monthly

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:56.370
Soy 
Milk

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.490
Hey, Aoyama.

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:01.080
So have you...

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:04.740
...held hands yet?

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:07.300
What was that sigh for?!

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:14.770
What's our next class?

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:16.670
Master!

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:27.410
Oh, look at the famous couple! So intense!

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:33.210
He left.

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:35.790
Well, of course he did, with all this ruckus.

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:43.350
Yeah, and then...

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:47.330
Ariga Sayaka.

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:51.640
Will you shake my hand?

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:53.370
What?

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:56.100
You want to shake hands? What?!

00:13:57.030 --> 00:14:00.090
Well, if you insist.

00:14:00.740 --> 00:14:01.610
There.

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:05.830
Stop making fun of me!

00:14:08.090 --> 00:14:10.780
Someone help! Aoyama collapsed!

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:12.530
Why?

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:15.230
What are you doing?!

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:17.000
Someone go fetch a teacher!

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:22.930
Bam!

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:25.780
Champion!

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:27.300
Aoyama, you're next.

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:29.680
Never, ever.

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:34.720
You idiot. As if Aoyama 
would ever arm wrestle.

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:36.910
When you're as germaphobic as he is,

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:40.790
I bet there are lots of
normal things you can't do.

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:41.660
Master!

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:46.680
I scored 30 points in my last match!

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:48.870
All of them by dunking.

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:50.930
I'm not sure if that's good or bad.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.430
Don't praise me so much.

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:55.200
Ever the optimist, huh?

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:58.930
Odagiri Mio.

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:01.660
That's the first time you've said my name.

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:10.420
<i>That last game was amazing.</i>

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:12.550
<i>Odagiri scored a lot of points.</i>

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:14.970
<i>She's been practicing dunks
the entire time.</i>

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:16.420
<i>I'm glad.</i>

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:21.880
<i>What's going on?!</i>

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:24.650
<i>Aoyama, are you seriously 
okay with Odagiri?!</i>

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.330
Ready! Go!

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:31.330
<i>Wait, so you actually 
wanted to arm wrestle?!</i>

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:41.380
<i>The desk is off-limits, but Odagiri's fine?</i>

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:42.670
<i>Doesn't that mean...</i>

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:58.940
Odagiri, those huge things are loose!

00:15:58.940 --> 00:15:59.820
Cover up!

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:00.980
Get a clue, girl!

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:04.050
Wait, what? Things were just getting good!

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:05.980
I can just fix it later.

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:07.830
That's not the issue.

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:08.980
Let's go.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.630
Bye, Master!

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:12.740
Aoyama!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.950
Thanks, dude.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:29.340
Yum.

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:36.180
I'm so hungry.

00:16:36.420 --> 00:16:40.550
I can't believe I forgot my lunch.

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:46.100
Master?

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:48.440
Is this lunch for me?

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:49.070
Yes.

00:16:50.010 --> 00:16:54.030
But in return, will you make 
a lunch for me tomorrow?

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:54.990
What?

00:16:55.310 --> 00:16:56.940
Are these two...

00:16:56.940 --> 00:16:58.990
...seriously...

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:01.950
...dating?!

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.170
Hey! What's going on here?

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:06.540
Master's lunch is so good...

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.580
Listen, will you?!

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:11.960
I must repay this debt in full tomorrow!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:16.850
Seriously?

00:17:16.850 --> 00:17:18.230
Don't push!

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:21.870
That's the principal's office.

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:23.500
Does he always eat here?

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:35.810
Since I'm forever in your debt, 
I've poured my heart into this lunch!

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:40.160
It's huge.

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:44.690
<i>Do you really think you can eat 
something someone else has made?</i>

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:56.960
Hold it right there!

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:59.330
We told you, no stealing the march!

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:01.950
I want to eat Odagiri's food, too!

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:04.180
Me, too!

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:08.800
So do you always eat in here?

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:09.550
Yes.

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:14.110
I heard you were allowed to eat in here
because you clean the room.

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:18.070
<i>This guy's trying to keep 
Odagiri all to himself.</i>

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:21.030
Odagiri Mio...

00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:26.000
Will you come watch our match this Sunday?

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:32.420
I didn't know Aoyama was that aggressive.

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:34.380
He's bold.

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:39.730
I see this as a declaration of war.

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:41.550
What will Odagiri say?

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:45.150
I will! I'll do my best to learn!

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:47.610
Are they meshing? Or aren't they?

00:18:47.610 --> 00:18:49.520
Are they just showing off?!

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:56.690
All right, quest complete!

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:57.950
Yay!

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:01.490
San-chan, you seem down.

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:06.700
Aoi Sanmyaku, it looks like
you're having troubles of the heart.

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:12.490
You're easy to read.
You yearn for human contact.

00:19:12.490 --> 00:19:13.670
That's not it.

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:20.400
What isn't? Just so you know, 
love is life's biggest waste of time.

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:22.780
All we should strive for is all-encompassing

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:23.840
<i>cleanliness.</i>

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:26.140
No! That's not it at all!

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:29.050
It's not love or anything like that!

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:35.570
I just don't know why I was 
okay with being touched!

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:38.510
<i>"Touched"? What's he talking about?</i>

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:39.610
<i>Who knows.</i>

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:42.030
<i>I guess if he's that insistent,
I'll believe him.</i>

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:45.650
<i>But, uh, he's getting stronger and stronger.</i>

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:57.750
Clean, clean, A-o-ya-ma...

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:01.810
Master's doing his best, Yuu-chan!

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:07.460
Odagiri, doesn't him asking you to 
watch his match mean he likes you?

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:03.690
Master!

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:15.780
Fujimi High School takes the lead. 
As expected, he's the scorer!

00:20:15.780 --> 00:20:18.070
Master? And me?

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:28.410
What's he doing?

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.350
<i>I see.</i>

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:45.740
<i>Aoyama-kun has always wanted
 to do all these things.</i>

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:51.270
Why don't you just date already?

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:54.580
What? You're not dating yet?

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:56.700
I thought you two were all lovey-dovey!

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:58.650
Uh, not really.

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:00.130
What? Seriously?!

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:01.510
You're not dating?

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:02.860
You're not all lovey-dovey?

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:05.020
Oh, so they're not dating.

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:05.950
Hm...

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:07.320
I have to spread this right away.

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:09.020
Aoyama's not dating her, apparently.

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:14.660
<b>Aoyama's not dating her</b>

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:14.660
<b>I'm so relieved</b>

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:14.660
<b>I believed!</b>

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:14.660
<b>I'll cheer extra hard now~</b>

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:14.660
<b>They weren't being 
lovey-dovey, after all!!</b>

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:18.090
Now that we know that, let's make some noise!

00:21:18.090 --> 00:21:19.610
One, two!

00:21:19.610 --> 00:21:23.220
Clean, clean, Aoyama!

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:26.700
Clean, clean, Aoyama!

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:25.580
Hey, Gotou, are you okay?

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:30.180
Clean, clean, Aoyama!

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:31.410
<i>I don't know if there are 
any romantic feelings there.</i>

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:32.760
<i>But...</i>

00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:41.500
<i>Maybe Aoyama-kun's just doing everything
he wants to do but can't with Odagiri-san.</i>

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:49.740
<i>Aoyama-kun! The fact you were 
dying to do a high five is just...</i>

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:54.700
<b>Aoyama Life</b>

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:52.100
<i>...too cute!</i>

00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:53.420
<i>It's too much!</i>

00:23:25.470 --> 00:23:27.760
Cleaning, cleaning.

00:23:35.170 --> 00:23:36.180
I love you.

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:41.500
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:41.500
<b>Umeya-kun Is Very Patient</b>
